# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Hiring form email delivery (Join The Team page)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The "Give Me The Form" popup emails applications to your inbox
# using Web3Forms (free, no backend needed).
#
# To turn it on:
#   1. Go to https://web3forms.com
#   2. Enter  infinitetutoringmelb@gmail.com  and submit
#   3. Web3Forms emails you an Access Key — copy it
#   4. Paste it below, then rename this file to  .env.local
#      (and add the same variable in your Vercel project settings)
#
# Applications will then be delivered to infinitetutoringmelb@gmail.com.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key-here
